<title>USA: Optimax cuts &quot;BB&quot; warrants exercise price.</title>
<headline>Optimax cuts &quot;BB&quot; warrants exercise price.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimax Industries Inc said Friday its board has approved the immediate reduction of the exercise price of its outstanding &quot;BB&quot; warrants to $1.00 from $3.00.</p>
<p>The warrants are traded on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market under the symbol UPMXZ.O and expire on April 1, 1999, it said.</p>
<p>Optimax is a holding company with interests in horticultural, giftware and security truck parts industries.</p>
